  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> be the image of the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> with respect to the plane <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math> The equation of the plane passing through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> and parallel to <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math> is",
