  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Image of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> w.r.t. plane <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>So, image is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Equation of the plane through <math><mi>P</mi></math> and parallel to <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math> is<br /><math><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
